  "__class__": "Meeting",
  "transcript": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": "00:21:02.050",
      "end": "00:21:04.670",
      "text": "Okay, good afternoon, everyone."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": "00:21:04.670",
      "end": "00:21:07.350",
      "text": "All the six meeting of the Corporate Services Committee"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": "00:21:07.350",
      "end": "00:21:11.700",
      "text": "to order, please check the city website"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": "00:21:11.700",
      "end": "00:21:13.680",
      "text": "for additional meeting detail information,"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": "00:21:13.680",
      "end": "00:21:15.930",
      "text": "meetings can be viewed via live streaming on YouTube"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": "00:21:15.930",
      "end": "00:21:17.710",
      "text": "and the city website."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": "00:21:17.710",
      "end": "00:21:19.950",
      "text": "The city of London is situated on the traditional lands"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": "00:21:19.950",
      "end": "00:21:22.480",
      "text": "of the National Bank, the Haudenosaunee,"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": "00:21:22.480",
      "end": "00:21:25.480",
      "text": "and the Leno Wampock and Nada Wandran."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": "00:21:25.480",
      "end": "00:21:27.180",
      "text": "We honor and respect the history, languages,"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": "00:21:27.180",
      "end": "00:21:30.130",
      "text": "and culture of the diverse indigenous people"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": "00:21:30.130",
      "end": "00:21:32.170",
      "text": "who call this territory home."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": "00:21:32.170",
      "end": "00:21:34.230",
      "text": "The city of London is currently home to many first nations,"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": "00:21:34.230",
      "end": "00:21:36.290",
      "text": "M\u00e9tis and Inuit today."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": "00:21:36.290",
      "end": "00:21:38.430",
      "text": "As representatives of the people of the city of London,"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": "00:21:38.430",
      "end": "00:21:40.850",
      "text": "we are grateful to have the opportunity to work"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": "00:21:40.850",
      "end": "00:21:43.400",
      "text": "and live in this territory."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": "00:21:43.400",
      "end": "00:21:46.270",
      "text": "We have all members of the committee present"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": "00:21:46.270",
      "end": "00:21:49.110",
      "text": "and some visiting counselors as well."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": "00:21:49.110",
      "end": "00:21:51.360",
      "text": "The city of London is committed to making every effort"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": "00:21:51.360",
      "end": "00:21:53.920",
      "text": "to provide alternative formats and communication supports"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": "00:21:53.920",
      "end": "00:21:55.890",
      "text": "from meetings upon request."
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": "00:21:55.890",
      "end": "00:21:58.090",
      "text": "To make a request specific to this meeting,"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": "00:21:58.090",
      "end": "00:22:02.900",
      "text": "please contact csc@london.ca or 519-661-2489"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": "00:22:02.900",
      "end": "00:22:07.240",
      "text": "extension 2425."
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": "00:22:07.240",
      "end": "00:22:11.500",
      "text": "We'll look to any disclosures of pecuniary interest."
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": "00:22:11.500",
      "end": "00:22:15.430",
      "text": "Okay, seeing none, we are on the consent items."
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": "00:22:15.430",
      "end": "00:22:18.720",
      "text": "I've not been given any direction to pull anything,"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": "00:22:18.720",
      "end": "00:22:21.480",
      "text": "so I'll look for a motion to put all of those on the floor."
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": "00:22:21.480",
      "end": "00:22:24.260",
      "text": "Okay, Councillor ramen, Councillor Cudi, thank you."
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": "00:22:24.260",
      "end": "00:22:25.960",
      "text": "Okay, so all of those are on the floor."
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": "00:22:25.960",
      "end": "00:22:36.480",
      "text": "Any questions or comments?"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": "00:22:36.480",
      "end": "00:22:38.810",
      "text": "Seeing any questions or comments?"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": "00:22:38.810",
      "end": "00:22:40.240",
      "text": "All right, well, okay."
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": "00:22:40.240",
      "end": "00:22:42.690",
      "text": "So we'll put all of those on the floor"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": "00:22:42.690",
      "end": "00:23:31.230",
      "text": "and I'll open that for voting."
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": "00:23:31.230",
      "end": "00:23:47.030",
      "text": "Councillor Stevenson, closing the motion carries."
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": "00:23:47.030",
      "end": "00:23:52.260",
      "text": "Five to zero."
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": "00:23:52.260",
      "end": "00:23:53.240",
      "text": "Okay, thank you."
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": "00:23:53.240",
      "end": "00:23:55.580",
      "text": "We are on to schedule items, which we have none."
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": "00:23:55.580",
      "end": "00:24:00.630",
      "text": "So items for direction, we do have four proclamations."
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": "00:24:00.630",
      "end": "00:24:02.400",
      "text": "The clerk has informed me that they all do have"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": "00:24:02.400",
      "end": "00:24:04.410",
      "text": "a London connection."
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start": "00:24:04.410",
      "end": "00:24:06.830",
      "text": "Oh, sorry, there's more than four."
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start": "00:24:06.830",
      "end": "00:24:08.000",
      "text": "We've got two pages worth."
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start": "00:24:08.000",
      "end": "00:24:10.930",
      "text": "We have quite a few proclamations."
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "start": "00:24:10.930",
      "end": "00:24:15.380",
      "text": "Can I get a motion to have those approved?"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "start": "00:24:15.380",
      "end": "00:24:17.560",
      "text": "Okay, Councillor Cudi, Councillor ramen."
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "start": "00:24:17.560",
      "end": "00:24:20.000",
      "text": "Okay, any questions or concerns on those?"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "start": "00:24:20.000",
      "end": "00:24:21.930",
      "text": "Do you wanna do all at the same times that you're saying?"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "start": "00:24:21.930",
      "end": "00:24:24.540",
      "text": "Yes, we'll just vote on them all."
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "start": "00:24:24.540",
      "end": "00:24:33.020",
      "text": "Yeah, these are for all the proclamations."
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "start": "00:24:33.020",
      "end": "00:24:37.150",
      "text": "Are there any questions or concerns with those?"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "start": "00:24:37.150",
      "end": "00:25:04.970",
      "text": "Seeing none, we'll move on to the vote."
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "start": "00:25:04.970",
      "end": "00:25:06.190",
      "text": "Closing the vote, motion carries."
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "start": "00:25:06.190",
      "end": "00:25:09.190",
      "text": "Five to zero."
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "start": "00:25:09.190",
      "end": "00:25:10.000",
      "text": "Okay, thank you for that."
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "start": "00:25:10.000",
      "end": "00:25:11.050",
      "text": "We're moving to light speed."
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "start": "00:25:11.050",
      "end": "00:25:13.530",
      "text": "Four minutes in, we're all (laughs)"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "start": "00:25:13.530",
      "end": "00:25:16.640",
      "text": "it's a good job, everyone."
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "start": "00:25:16.640",
      "end": "00:25:18.970",
      "text": "Sorry, we do also have 4.7,"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "start": "00:25:18.970",
      "end": "00:25:20.820",
      "text": "which is the consideration for the appointment"
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "start": "00:25:20.820",
      "end": "00:25:24.070",
      "text": "to the animal welfare community advisory committee."
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "start": "00:25:24.070",
      "end": "00:25:24.920",
      "text": "So that's a separate vote."
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "start": "00:25:24.920",
      "end": "00:25:26.450",
      "text": "Can I get a motion for that one?"
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "start": "00:25:26.450",
      "end": "00:25:29.100",
      "text": "Okay, so Councillor Cudi, Councillor ramen."
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "start": "00:25:29.100",
      "end": "00:25:31.610",
      "text": "Guys are tagged even in all the votes today, okay."
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "start": "00:25:31.610",
      "end": "00:25:33.650",
      "text": "We'll open that for voting."
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "start": "00:25:33.650",
      "end": "00:25:38.090",
      "text": "I'm sorry, are there any questions or concerns on that?"
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "start": "00:25:38.090",
      "end": "00:25:49.730",
      "text": "Also not seeing any, so yes, we'll open that for voting."
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "start": "00:25:49.730",
      "end": "00:25:50.950",
      "text": "Closing the vote, motion carries."
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "start": "00:25:50.950",
      "end": "00:25:54.310",
      "text": "Five to zero."
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "start": "00:25:54.310",
      "end": "00:25:56.320",
      "text": "Okay, so we have no deferred matters."
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "start": "00:25:56.320",
      "end": "00:25:58.060",
      "text": "We are on to confidential."
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "start": "00:25:58.060",
      "end": "00:26:00.420",
      "text": "So we'll shuffle some staff around"
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "start": "00:26:00.420",
      "end": "00:26:03.590",
      "text": "and get to that momentarily."
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "start": "00:26:03.590",
      "end": "00:26:04.380",
      "text": "Oh, sorry, we need to vote"
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "start": "00:26:04.380",
      "end": "00:26:05.900",
      "text": "to go into the confidential session first."
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "start": "00:26:05.900",
      "end": "00:26:08.350",
      "text": "Okay, Councillor Cudi, Councillor Stevenson."
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "start": "00:26:08.350",
      "end": "00:26:17.160",
      "text": "Okay, we'll open that for voting."
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "start": "00:26:17.160",
      "end": "00:26:18.340",
      "text": "Closing the vote, motion carries."
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "start": "00:26:18.340",
      "end": "00:26:20.710",
      "text": "Five to zero."
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "start": "00:26:20.710",
      "end": "00:26:23.870",
      "text": "Okay, just give us a moment to get set up."
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "start": "00:26:23.870",
      "end": "00:26:37.400",
      "text": "Recording in progress."
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "start": "00:26:37.400",
      "end": "00:28:40.500",
      "text": "He's gonna be up there, so he's gonna come in."
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "start": "00:28:40.500",
      "end": "00:30:34.260",
      "text": "Okay, we're back in public session."
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "start": "00:30:34.260",
      "end": "00:30:57.680",
      "text": "Last Councillor Cudi to report out on our confidential session."
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "start": "00:30:57.680",
      "end": "00:30:59.450",
      "text": "Thank you, Chair."
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "start": "00:30:59.450",
      "end": "00:31:04.920",
      "text": "That's three of you, meeting that in closed session"
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "start": "00:31:04.920",
      "end": "00:31:11.340",
      "text": "from 105 to 155 PM to discuss confidential matters"
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "start": "00:31:11.340",
      "end": "00:31:13.460",
      "text": "and progress that was made on all subjects."
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "start": "00:31:13.460",
      "end": "00:31:15.870",
      "text": "Thank you, Chair."
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "start": "00:31:15.870",
      "end": "00:31:17.150",
      "text": "Thank you."
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "start": "00:31:17.150",
      "end": "00:31:19.120",
      "text": "We are at adjournment."
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "start": "00:31:19.120",
      "end": "00:31:23.980",
      "text": "So looking for a vote in terms of adjournment of motion."
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "start": "00:31:23.980",
      "end": "00:31:26.800",
      "text": "Okay, Councillor Cudi, Councillor Stevenson."
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "start": "00:31:26.800",
      "end": "00:31:30.080",
      "text": "Okay, all those in favor to adjourn."
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "start": "00:31:30.080",
      "end": "00:31:32.240",
      "text": "Opposed?"
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "start": "00:31:32.240",
      "end": "00:31:33.110",
      "text": "Okay, thank you, everyone."
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "start": "00:31:33.110",
      "end": "00:31:33.890",
      "text": "Motion carries."
    }
